WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Lifecycle claims depend on system boundaries, energy sources, lifetime and end-of-life assumptions. Compare like with like.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A recycling comparison needs the same mass basis and included process stages on both sides.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Lifecycle boundary sort

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A material category is not a guarantee of strength, durability or safety. Processing and test conditions matter.

